# Eastern Keel | SEO Audit | Read Only, No Changes | 2026

*Standards verified June 2026. Key facts this revision pins down: Google published its official AI Optimization Guide on May 15, 2026, which states plainly that no special schema, llms.txt, or AI specific markup is needed for AI Overviews or AI Mode. FAQ rich results ended for all sites in May 2026. HowTo ended in 2023. Sitelinks search box ended Nov 2024. INP is 200ms. Core Web Vitals thresholds are unchanged. WCAG 2.2 AA is the audit target; the US ADA Title II deadlines were extended in April 2026 to April 26, 2027 (entities serving 50,000 or more) and April 26, 2028 (smaller entities).*

