## 8. Copy rules, for any new content written

- No hyphens in body copy. "wellbeing" not "well-being".
- No hyphenated phone numbers. "(555) 123 4567" not the hyphenated form.
- No AI filler: never "dive into", "leverage", "utilize", "in order to", "it's important to note", "let's explore", "I'd be happy to".

